---
// Schematic only — no invented content. Shows what happens, not a fake answer.
---
<svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 640 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="mx-t mx-d">
  <title id="mx-t">How Matrix answers a question</title>
  <desc id="mx-d">Documents go into a phone. On the device they are split, embedded and searched; the answer comes back with the exact source sentence and its location.</desc>
  <!-- documents -->
  <g class="d-docs">
    <rect x="18" y="86" width="96" height="124" rx="6" />
    <rect x="30" y="74" width="96" height="124" rx="6" />
    <rect x="42" y="62" width="96" height="124" rx="6" class="front" />
    <line x1="56" y1="90" x2="124" y2="90" /><line x1="56" y1="104" x2="118" y2="104" />
    <line x1="56" y1="118" x2="124" y2="118" /><line x1="56" y1="132" x2="110" y2="132" />
    <line x1="56" y1="146" x2="124" y2="146" /><line x1="56" y1="160" x2="104" y2="160" />
    <text x="78" y="238" text-anchor="middle">thousands of pages</text>
  </g>
  <path class="d-arrow" d="M150 150 H196" /><path class="d-head" d="M190 144 L198 150 L190 156" />
  <!-- phone -->
  <g class="d-phone">
    <rect x="206" y="20" width="168" height="260" rx="26" />
    <rect x="262" y="32" width="56" height="8" rx="4" class="notch" />
    <text x="290" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="d-small">airplane mode</text>
    <g class="d-steps">
      <rect x="226" y="86" width="128" height="34" rx="8" /><text x="290" y="108" text-anchor="middle">split</text>
      <rect x="226" y="130" width="128" height="34" rx="8" /><text x="290" y="152" text-anchor="middle">embed</text>
      <rect x="226" y="174" width="128" height="34" rx="8" /><text x="290" y="196" text-anchor="middle">search &amp; read</text>
      <rect x="226" y="218" width="128" height="34" rx="8" class="hot" /><text x="290" y="240" text-anchor="middle" class="hot-t">answer</text>
    </g>
  </g>
  <path class="d-arrow" d="M384 236 H430" /><path class="d-head" d="M424 230 L432 236 L424 242" />
  <!-- answer card -->
  <g class="d-card">
    <rect x="440" y="150" width="184" height="128" rx="10" />
    <line x1="456" y1="174" x2="600" y2="174" /><line x1="456" y1="188" x2="580" y2="188" />
    <rect x="452" y="202" width="160" height="38" rx="4" class="quote" />
    <line x1="462" y1="215" x2="600" y2="215" class="q" /><line x1="462" y1="228" x2="572" y2="228" class="q" />
    <text x="456" y="262" class="d-small">exact sentence + where it is</text>
  </g>
</svg>
<style>
  .diagram { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; font-family: var(--display); }
  .diagram text { fill: var(--fg); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .diagram .d-small { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
  .d-docs rect { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .d-docs rect.front { fill: var(--surface); }
  .d-docs line, .d-card line { stroke: var(--line-strong); stroke-width: 4; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .d-arrow { stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 2.5; fill: none; }
  .d-head { stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 2.5; fill: none; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .d-phone > rect { fill: var(--surface); stroke: var(--fg); stroke-width: 3; }
  .d-phone .notch { fill: var(--fg); stroke: none; }
  .d-steps rect { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--line-strong); stroke-width: 2; }
  .d-steps rect.hot { fill: var(--accent); stroke: var(--accent); }
  .d-steps .hot-t { fill: var(--on-accent); }
  .d-card rect:first-child { fill: var(--surface); stroke: var(--fg); stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .d-card .quote { fill: var(--highlight); stroke: none; }
  .d-card line.q { stroke: var(--fg); stroke-width: 4; opacity: .7; }
</style>
